                      formData.gender === 'Masculino'
                        ? 'bg-[#253827] text-white border-[#253827] shadow-xs'
                        : 'bg-stone-50 text-stone-600 border-stone-200 hover:bg-stone-100'
                    }`}
                  >
                    <span>♂ Masculino (El paciente)</span>
                  </button>
                  <button
